WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.600
A star came to my hometown!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.440
His name is D.D. Esper Robin!

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.980
But Fuya, the actor
who plays Robin, isn’t like him.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:13.740
Trying to meet his mother’s expectations,
he transforms into the real Robin!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.380
Fuya, I’ll break your curse!

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.660
I end my turn!

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.250
Fuya! Galaxy Queen!

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.960
You must always protect Robin’s image!

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.950
No one can save me.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:39.350
Fuya, this Number
is like your soul!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.350
I know!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yuma?

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.210
Yuma, why are you
calling so late?

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.040
Kotori, it’s an emergency!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.060
I want you and Tetsuo
to bring Fuya’s mother.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:57.680
I’m dueling Fuya— I mean, Robin.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:00.080
I want her
to watch this duel!

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.140
Yuma...

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.270
Okay!

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:07.540
I’m counting on you, Kotori.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:12.840
Fuya, I’ll return you to normal!

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.970
I’m kattobing!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.680
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.830
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.860
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:32.980
Freedom begins by accepting differences
Dance and create the universe

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:40.370
In truth, I was sad until I met you

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:47.020
I lied, thinking it was easier to be alone

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:53.460
Even though we don’t like the same books or hobbies

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:57.340
You’re the only one who agreed with me

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:00.470
Joy and sadness and anger and do re mi fa so la ti do

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.450
There’s no harmony and scenario without differences

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.560
Everyone is not the same

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.560
That’s the reason for living

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:15.820
Even if the sounds are dissonant at times

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:21.240
That’s why I never give up
I believe my strength will get me through

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:25.250
I travel to the edge of the world

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.960
The sights I see with you are the truth

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.790
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.340
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.420
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.550
Freedom begins by accepting differences
Dance and create the universe

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:52.940
Star Robin Forever

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:52.940
Number 8:

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:52.050
Yuma, Star Robin can deal piercing damage until the next turn.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:56.400
In order to survive his attack, you must use Utopia’s effect.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.320
I know that!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:04.580
But even if I want to summon Utopia,
I only have one Level 4 monster in my hand.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:07.830
Everything depends on my draw.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.250
My turn! I draw!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.080
It’s here!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.000
Here I go!

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:19.470
I summon Gagaga Magician!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.390
Then I Special Summon Kagetokage!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.960
Kagetokage can’t be Normal Summoned.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:35.990
I can Special Summon it from my hand
when I summon a Level 4 monster!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:41.240
I overlay Level 4 Gagaga
Magician and Kagetokage!

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:45.370
With these two monsters,
I build the Overlay Network!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.450
Xyz Summon!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:51.950
Appear, Number 39: Utopia!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.670
Yuma, you should defeat
as many monsters as you can.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.920
I know!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:07.680
But due to Dead Max’s Curse’s effect,
Galaxy Queen can’t be destroyed.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.050
What is it?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.340
You’re too obedient today.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.600
Whatever!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.620
I’m dueling for Fuya!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.440
I don’t have time
to argue with you!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.190
I feel the same.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.950
It’s unlike you to duel for
somebody else’s sake!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.660
He was alone.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.300
No one can save me.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:39.250
I know how he feels.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.710
You...

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:45.830
Our goals are the same
for this duel.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.090
Whatever!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.260
Even if our goals
are the same, I’m me!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.310
Let’s win!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.770
Yeah! Go, Utopia!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:58.330
Attack Beast Warrior Puma!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.820
Not good enough!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.730
I activate my trap!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.240
Wings of Unity!

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:03.800
You fail!

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:11.450
With the trap card Wings of Unity, if you battle
when Star Robin is on my field, your attack is negated!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:16.230
Then I Special Summon
Phoenix Beast Gairuda!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.960
Special Summon a Level 6 monster?

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.930
Are you okay?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.410
You came!

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.580
You’re late, Gairuda.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.390
I made it in time.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.920
What’s with those monsters?

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.850
Are they acting out
a TV scene?

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:39.810
I can’t believe I’m seeing
this right before my eyes!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:43.320
But you were going to
the princess.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:47.050
I can’t leave my
true friends behind.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:49.160
Gairuda... Puma...

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.480
Robin!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:54.480
They have a strong bond.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.160
I don’t know why,
but it warms my heart.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.040
This isn’t the time
to admire them!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:06.010
He stopped my attack,
and he has four monsters on his field!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:11.260
Due to Phoenix Beast Gairuda’s
effect, I draw one card!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.310
Damn!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.310
What can I do?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.520
You must defend.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:20.290
Use the card on the right.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:20.980
This?

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:26.990
I don’t understand,
but I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.710
My turn! I draw!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.410
I summon another friend.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.910
What? Another one?

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:43.040
When D.D. Esper Star Robin, Beast Warrior Puma
and Phoenix Beast Gairuda are on my field...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:46.210
I can Special Summon
this card from my hand.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.780
Our lavish friend!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.930
Appear, Ironhammer the Giant!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.310
What?

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.850
Ironhammer is here!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.310
Ironhammer the Giant.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:10.490
It’s a metal warrior that was almost discarded because it didn’t have enough screws in its head, but Robin saved it.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:15.580
Now that I’m here,
I won’t let you lay a finger on Robin!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.750
3500 DEF?

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.310
How can I defeat that?

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.790
Yuma!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.740
We brought her!

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.460
It’s Fuya’s mother!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.420
What’s going on?

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.350
Is that Fuya?

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:36.380
Fuya!

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.430
Is that really you, Fuya?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.600
What are you doing, Fuya?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.150
Who are you?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.740
What are you talking about?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:47.820
I’m your mother!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.780
You? What a strange
thing to say.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.610
My mother is here!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.830
Fuya...

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.700
I’m not Fuya.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:02.540
I’m D.D. Esper Robin!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.840
What?

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.440
Fuya’s mother!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.340
Fuya is behind the incidents.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.760
No, I mean Robin!

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:14.180
That’s nonsense!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:18.180
He tried hard to meet
your expectations!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:24.100
So he now can’t come back
from the haction world!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.580
Haction?

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.670
Did he mean “fiction?”

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.820
No way! Fuya!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:37.480
Robin, keep bringing me
the glory of darkness!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.320
That’s me?

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.120
Fuya, listen to me!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.880
Stop it!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.500
Please be quiet
and watch this duel!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.590
See how Fuya pictures his mother!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.180
I’m continuing this duel.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:01.810
I use an Overlay Unit
to activate Galaxy Queen’s effect again!

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:08.190
All my monsters are indestructible
and deal piercing damage until my next turn!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:15.060
Star Robin and friends,
accept my magic again!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:19.990
Defeat those
who stand in your way!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.610
Understood!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.700
Gairuda’s effect activates.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:27.960
When Gairuda attacks,
it gains 300 ATK.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.540
Go! Attack Utopia!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.330
Yuma!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.550
I know!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:37.590
I use one Overlay Unit
to activate Utopia’s effect!

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.060
Gairuda’s attack is negated!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.060
But I can still attack!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.600
Take my lavish battle!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.520
Star Robin, attack Utopia!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.030
Surprise Punch!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.610
I activate Utopia’s effect again!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.820
That attack is negated!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.280
But Utopia has run
out of Overlay Units.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.060
You were too lavish!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.330
I activate Ironhammer the Giant’s effect!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:17.850
When Ironhammer is on the field, one of my Level
4-or-below monsters can attack you directly once per turn!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.550
What?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.930
Go, Puma!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.050
Attack him directly!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.740
Black Slash!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.860
Yuma!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.820
Damn...

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.990
At this rate...

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.380
Damn!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.780
Yuma, activate your trap card.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.000
Trap card?

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:48.000
Trust me.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.710
Sheesh.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.900
I activate a trap card!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:58.220
With the trap card Heartfelt Appeal,
when I take damage from your direct attack...

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:05.390
I gain control of your monster
with the most DEF until my next turn!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:11.770
Ironhammer, you’re betraying us?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.420
I’m not!

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:17.230
But I can’t let you defeat
someone so unskilled!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.940
Umm...

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.660
I don’t have a choice.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.710
I set one card.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.300
I end my turn.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:28.750
Why did we take Ironhammer?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:32.580
It’ll go back to
Robin on his next turn.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.390
It’s fine.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:37.550
I need it to defeat them.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.960
I don’t understand.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.980
By the way, you watch
the TV show, right?

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:45.300
What happens in the end?

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.020
The ending was...

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.590
You know it?

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:53.580
I didn’t see it because
you turned off the TV.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.980
It’s my fault?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.030
My turn! I draw!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:04.990
I can’t give up
on this duel.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:10.000
Fuya, I’ll turn
you back to normal.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.960
I activate the Continuous
Spell Attraffic Control!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:21.130
When there are three or more monsters
on your field, you can’t attack!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.240
This will buy me time.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.130
Yuma.

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.910
What is it?

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.720
We now have all
the pieces for victory.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.380
We’ll win.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.190
Win?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:38.120
Galaxy Queen can’t be destroyed
due to Dead Max’s Curse.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:44.360
Due to Galaxy Queen’s Overlay Unit’s effect,
his monsters are immortal.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.330
I saw it!

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:53.830
When Robin’s family is together,
Robin will transform Ironhammer into D.D. Jet Iron.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.500
It will use its Iron Phoenix special move
to destroy the enemy.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.500
You Robin fanatic!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.970
Yuma, set the two
cards in your hand.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.940
These cards?

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:13.900
I don’t like you ordering me around,
but I set two cards and end my turn!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.440
Pointless.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.900
My turn! I draw!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:26.860
Your trap card’s effect ends,
so Ironhammer returns to my field.

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:31.080
What have I been doing?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.890
Star Robin! Punish him!

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:35.540
I know, Mother!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.000
Please stop, Fuya!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.730
Be quiet!

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.180
I’m Robin!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.390
I have to keep being Robin!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.810
Fuya...

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.690
You thought Attraffic Control
would stop me from attacking.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.860
I activate the trap
card Change to Jet Iron!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:11.030
When Robin’s family is on the field,
I can tribute them to Special Summon D.D. Jet Iron!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.990
Come, Jet Iron!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.960
What?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:26.720
D.D. Jet Iron’s ATK are equal
to the total ATK of the tributed monsters.

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:30.420
Therefore, it has 8000 ATK!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:33.280
8000 ATK?

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.860
How can I win?

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.060
Don’t get flustered.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.770
Use a trap card.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.840
Trap card?

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:44.360
Which one should I activate?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.100
Oh yeah!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.280
This is the time
for duel food!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.490
Sheesh, Yuma...

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:57.450
All right! I’m thinking clearer!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:02.170
I activate the trap
card Fiery Fervor!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.620
Wow!

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.480
Utopia’s ATK doubled!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:12.680
But Jet Iron has
8000 ATK!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.560
That was pointless!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.720
Give up!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:20.140
My monsters have combined
and become one.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:27.280
Your Attraffic Control’s effect doesn’t activate
unless I have three or more monsters on my field!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.390
Damn!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.360
I activate a trap!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.280
I’m the one who activates traps!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.080
I activate the trap Reserve Cyclone!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.660
With Reserve Cyclone, when
a monster changes control to the opponent...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:45.540
...one spell or trap card is destroyed
when that card is tributed.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.260
That means I’ll destroy...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.430
Dead Max’s Curse!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.240
What?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:08.610
Now there aren’t any cards
protecting Galaxy Queen.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.820
But you can’t stop my attack!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.810
My lavish special move!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.960
Jet Iron, attack Utopia!

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.660
Go! Iron Phoenix!

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.210
We failed!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.800
No, this is fine.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:30.510
There is still one
trap card on your field.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.380
Trap card?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.970
We now have all
the pieces for victory.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.750
I see.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.810
You were expecting this to happen!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.470
Here I go!

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.480
I activate my trap!

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.980
Vector Change!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:50.660
When your monster attacks,
it switches to defense position!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:51.650
What?

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:56.620
And one of your face-up monsters in defense
position switches to attack position!

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.540
No way!

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.540
I can’t attack.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:07.960
Mother...

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.020
I...

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.600
No, it’s not over!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:16.350
I set one card.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.890
I end my turn.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.010
My turn! I draw!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.120
All right!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.230
If he attacks Galaxy Queen...

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.330
He’ll defeat Robin!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:29.150
Yuma, are you prepared to attack?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:34.690
If that set card is a counter
that reflects back attacks, we’ll lose.

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:40.450
This is our only chance
to win the duel.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.410
And the only chance
to return Fuya to normal!

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:49.330
Fine.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.550
Here I go!

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:54.430
I’m kattobing!

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:58.010
Utopia attacks Galaxy Queen!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:03.770
Hope Sword Slash!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:09.730
I activate the trap card
Star Robin Forever!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.940
What? Is it a counter?

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:21.770
When you attack, Star Robin in my graveyard resurrects
with 0 ATK and is attacked instead!

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:37.920
Fuya!

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.350
Yuma won!

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.330
It wasn’t a counter.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:56.570
Then why?

00:18:57.090 --> 00:19:02.280
Bringing back Star Robin
with 0 ATK couldn’t affect the outcome.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.990
Why did he do something pointless?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.250
It’s not pointless.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.210
Fuya wanted to protect her.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.960
He wanted to protect his mother.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.140
This memory...

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.520
Fuya.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.070
Fuya...

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:44.990
Mother!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.160
What happened to me?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.880
It’s fine now, Fuya.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.960
I didn’t know
you felt this way.

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:55.900
Mother...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.380
I was wrong. I’m sorry.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.700
Mother...

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.270
Mom...

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.980
I’m jealous!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:29.120
He can change back
to his real self.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:33.750
But Yuma, why didn’t you tell me
about Robin earlier?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:38.840
If you found out that Robin was
the culprit, you would be sad.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.380
You care how I feel.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:47.230
I don’t care, you idiot!

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:49.010
Don’t call me an idiot!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.730
You have no delicacy!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.670
What’s a “delivery?”

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:57.650
It’s your fault
for being a Robin fanatic!

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:09.000
Impossible!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:09.910
My power is...

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.400
Robin.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:26.940
Robin.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:27.930
Mother...

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:31.470
Mother!

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.680
What a wonderful story!

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.160
Right?

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:38.010
Observation #10:

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:43.860
I am allowed to understand the love between
a human parent and a child.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.030
My memory...

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:55.900
It was the memory
of when I was born.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:01.050
Your name is Astral.

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:08.350
I’m giving you a mission
with the fate of this world in your hands.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:15.070
Let’s start the duel!

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:20.530
When Normal Summoning a monster,
attack position is face-up.

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:24.820
For defense position,
is it face-up or face-down?

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:34.720
Today’s test is hard
Can’t avoid pleasure and temptation

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:39.880
I want to go home and watch TV
Recent cartoons are entertaining

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:54.320
Anyway, tests are hard
Language, math and English are especially hard

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:59.480
Average scores in science and social studies
I’m only good at P.E.

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:01.900
(Wait, Baby!) The expected

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:04.520
(What’s that, Baby!) Answers

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:07.180
(Wait a sec, Baby!) Remember them

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:08.840
(What are we!? Baby!) For who

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:13.480
Let’s say I wrote the correct answers on that sheet

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:18.040
Will that change the future a year or a decade from now?

00:23:18.070 --> 00:23:23.420
The world I drew at the edge of dreams

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:28.090
Someday I’ll race in the sky

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.220
Nobody can threaten my heart

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:36.990
Nothing is correct!

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:46.900
What? Kotori was kidnapped?

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:49.820
And I’ll only get her back by winning a duel?

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.200
Is this a Number’s fault?

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:55.480
I don’t care if it’s a Number or not!

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:59.000
Kotori, I’ll save you!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:09.970
Surprising Cat Deck?!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:04.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZEXAL:
“Surprising Cat Deck?!”

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:09.970
Surprising Cat Deck?!

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:07.280
I’m kattobing!

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:13.860
The answer is...

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:17.050
Facedown!

00:24:17.050 --> 00:24:21.810
Set it face-down horizontally.

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.980
It’s easy to make a mistake, so be careful!
